&lt;p style="margin-left: 120px; text-align: left; text-indent: -48px"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 48px; text-align: left; text-indent: -48px"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfBoardOfDirectorsMeetingTextBlock>
